g":"tformat","target":"用护盾环绕自己，吸收 %d%% 火焰、寒冷、光系、奥术伤害，每次最多吸收 %d 伤害。\n\t\t每次你的护盾吸收伤害时，将部分攻击转化为能量，获得 1 点灵能值；每吸收 %0.1f 点伤害，还会额外获得 1 点灵能值，每回合最多获得 %0.1f 点灵能值。\n\t\t技能等级达到 3 时，关闭护盾会将此前 3 回合吸收的伤害（若有）的两倍转化为一个全效灵能护盾（吸收所有伤害）。\n\t\t护盾每次最多能吸收的伤害以及获得灵能值的效率随精神强度提高。\n\t\t你同时只能维持两个此类护盾。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e9757e71e26334f07cd07415978f2fd9f312e28ab1754621f562f6e210ad659e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"19b93a2eb81d92dc48a21ba14016c2af81329b8a568178c464d9b139d7a42d68","logical_entry_identity":"8e6f94e78e73bf5b07aff612f620d7289e7e4dfa92fe202bc5a238df23fa627a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_BLUE#You enter a zero gravity zone, beware!","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"#LIGHT_BLUE#注意！你进入了失重区域！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"781e905d19df950381706a812151c7d18688912a1fb8343bd32dbebaabb19eaa","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"19be108c934f3ff5a400a55e4507eef06941accff5363b68a96d15b5f9c4e940","logical_entry_identity":"afbbc956247686c9d7de9e15af1b64b398da5c096f5f18518656b1d2ac4e4fee","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"I will make him pay for his treachery.","source_tag":"_t","target":"我会让他为自己的背叛付出代价。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"39b8f0083d7d31d207fbbe8da5fbf5ea83258382b4cbbe07e40ec3337f6218a1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"19c03c6cbc40eef2720d0139370485cc0461f9a9a2d43137e7389f0b2abd4e15","logical_entry_identity":"e2f2f59a846f3a8a09c882e5e7a3d1822b85e91da08491e9ccc20d08815e6261","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"As a reward you %s.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"作为奖励，你%s。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"02889d2c0baef48f8309a89f4cf68d1ff90b2dd57186c3be9c0911bbac671108","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"19c293598356f67bc13f4b310947c54c258370491de83b697a6a6624008d17da","logical_entry_identity":"579be4ca7a7872f5dacf06431e09a6a353b1ee8476f7df74b2e8f51c1c0d9c4e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Sorry, I have to go!","source_tag":"chat_zigur-mindstar-store","targe