a","source":"You may not auto-explore this level.","source_tag":"log","target":"你不能自动探索这一层。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1db7bd7e680c2fa85cbe3a32eb435f010f7358d6678c4524cc7dca4bd1c2eaad","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"19e06001b204047ff34a497756b57ee47843a090b43fba20e6329875181aa565","logical_entry_identity":"0fb236573619f33cd759aebc4298d61cd7a2103112128a1147e1fb23302f6ddc","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Auto-validate targets. If you fire an arrow/talent/... it will automatically use the default target without asking\n#LIGHT_RED#This is dangerous. Do not enable unless you know exactly what you are doing.#WHITE#\n\nDefault target is always either one of:\n - The last creature hovered by the mouse\n - The last attacked creature\n - The closest creature","source_tag":"_t","target":"自动选择目标。使用技能、装备等时不再要求指定目标。\n#LIGHT_RED#注意：这非常危险。除非你确切知道自己在做什么，否则不要启用。#WHITE#\n\n默认目标会遵循以下规则选择：\n - 最后一个鼠标划过的目标。\n - 最后一个攻击的目标\n - 最近的目标"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8023fb5a8741f25dc5e536393a4a53632e36bbdb8b98837ca7cc43f7b7ecccee","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"19e7531e9585e23c509a4c1a10f11dee7682b4dce537359134f7a2621604c0a2","logical_entry_identity":"758ddf123d6b80c49a8f1babe737d460e4b28df3a63242b2b3304f5b4e4c9d04","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"cold flames","source_tag":"_t","target":"冷火"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"774854d5dba357f8f7bcd93fa6c9174198196624df2f1821ff1cb3c28eac4635","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"19e93345968c937cd0d5723d1e81d848682c0b68e159f9585ec9745a1e64c514","logical_entry_identity":"e388bb2a7a3d6f5fb2d370f13d7f5b79885e78e4617b8ee40f4e4c7631841fa9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You absorb latent cold around you, turning into an ice elemental - a shivgoroth - for %d turns.\n\t\tWhile transformed, you do not need to breathe, gain access to the Ice Storm talent at level %d, gain %d%% resistance to cuts and stuns, gain %d%% cold resistance, and all cold damage heals you for %d%% of the damage done.\n\t\tThe power will increase with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你吸收周围的寒冰围绕你，将自己转变为纯粹的冰元素——西弗格罗斯，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t转化成元素后，你不需要呼吸并获得等级 %d 的冰雪风暴，获得 %d%% 切割和震慑抵抗，%d%% 寒冰抗性，所有冰冷伤害可对你产生治疗，治疗量基于伤害值的 %d%%。\n\t\t效果受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"671df7f49c1502c57c03a3a59421e324d37179281b8ca405f276d1a08359c23c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"19f0ee3eb3ad98fb83c36a74e72d660f38fccf27779808f4cd573be85fb87ad3","logical_entry_identity":"dbb478b6aadea30b72c1641ab1e687ad628113d26f28d567f99dbede8146a317","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_BLUE#Could not generate a base object with filter: %s","source_tag":"log","target":"#LIGHT_BLUE#无法使用该筛选器生成基础物品：%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"870f8b573f9f79132d121aaffd0be07b91468699f61971dd43d365a7780e86f9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"19f36b4394b1ea2a6224f9cf51e18bb2c8a3b8e1c87a2eb8f4e42c20da52f611","logical_entry_identity":"6c643c74e289759ce9fe0b06cd92e149dbd7181160bf084cf8f1d3eeb25e36c8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"breakable ice wall","source_tag":"entity name","target":"可以打破的冰墙"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"67ebdd66dc25bd49fb0fea29b25bed6aafa33d3f785f8095156da5e00d2c58d7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"19f89531f6ba14af5a83f4c7d1a2a1c50560c41676cc7c724d9dc8e6253c0543","logical_entry_identity":"0a98842d5aaeaee626c3d7ddcffa4f6aec4e5167e992789b996b39b52a5f3081","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Shadow Cut","source_tag":"_t","target":"暗影伤口"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e12e6c244e4a4dd188df08dd9d381db3b1fcfaa87ac12c5226f14b2a790a955b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"19fcb9395d6fe1e3234fe3aecde6a5aa621763f0fae5f355df00864f6cf62ba8","logical_entry_identity":"a4a5f388575b8abfe244b3165fc0cfca030ef2c80e1dd100421cc1fe6229ba5f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_BLUE#The illusion covering #Target# disappears.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_BLUE##Target#周围的幻影消失